<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-lībro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make exactly level</i>, <i>to level.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Col. 3,
				13, 13</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">permensum et perlibratum opus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					13 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">planities non perlibrata, sed exigua prona,</span>”
				<i>not level</i>, <i>not horizontal</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					2, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si quis Excelsa perlibrat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 27</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to hurl</i> with a
			vibratory motion (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saevamque bipennem Perlibrans mediae fronti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					2, 189</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hastam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 5,
					321</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jaculum a tergo ad ossa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					15, 699</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
